# Relaunch Gallery after UI changes

The user reviews all visual work in the running Gallery app. After any change that
affects control visuals (templates, styles, tokens, Gallery pages):

1. Rebuild: `dotnet build samples\Ether.DesignSystem.Gallery\Ether.DesignSystem.Gallery.csproj -p:Platform=x64`
2. Close any previously agent-launched Gallery instance, then start the new build:
   `samples\Ether.DesignSystem.Gallery\bin\x64\Debug\net8.0-windows10.0.19041.0\Ether.DesignSystem.Gallery.exe`
3. Leave the app running for the user — do not kill it after verification screenshots.

Take a screenshot for before/after evidence when useful, but the running app is the
primary review surface.
